---
config:
  theme: base
  fontFamily: "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 24
    width: 130
    diagramMarginX: 10
    boxMargin: 12
    boxTextMargin: 8
    messageMargin: 40
    noteMargin: 22
    labelBoxWidth: 56
    labelBoxHeight: 28
    messageFontSize: 16
    actorFontSize: 16
    noteFontSize: 15
    wrap: false
  themeVariables:
    textColor: "#8b5cf6"
    actorBkg: "#ede9fe"
    actorBorder: "#7c3aed"
    actorTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    actorLineColor: "#a78bfa"
    signalColor: "#8b949e"
    signalTextColor: "#6e7781"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#ccfbf1"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#0d9488"
    labelTextColor: "#134e4a"
    loopTextColor: "#0d9488"
    noteBkgColor: "#fef3c7"
    noteBorderColor: "#d97706"
    noteTextColor: "#78350f"
    activationBkgColor: "#c4b5fd"
    activationBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    mainBkg: "#ede9fe"
    nodeBorder: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    secondaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    tertiaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    tertiaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    tertiaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
  themeCSS: >
    svg, .label, .nodeLabel, .edgeLabel, foreignObject div { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .actor { filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18)); }
    rect.actor { rx: 12px; ry: 12px; }
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Rig as FocusStack
    participant Rosbridge as rosbridge
    participant Watcher as Watcher
    participant Steps as Steps 1 to 3

    Watcher->>Rosbridge: subscribe to stack_done<br/>and all_stacks_done
    loop every angle
        Note over Rig: last picture saved,<br/>writes stack.json
        Rig->>Rosbridge: stack_done,<br/>the angle's folder
        Rosbridge->>Watcher: publish, JSON
        Note over Rig,Watcher: the folder copied over HTTP
        Watcher->>Steps: the angle
        Steps-->>Watcher: 3_graded/angle.tif
    end
    Note over Rig: last angle done,<br/>writes all_stacks.json
    Rig->>Rosbridge: all_stacks_done,<br/>the session's folder
    Rosbridge->>Watcher: publish, JSON
    Note over Rig,Watcher: all_stacks.json copied over HTTP
    Note over Watcher: quilt and show
